<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Process.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Integrated Process.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist said its analyst Gus Richard has raised earnings estimates for Integrated Process Equipment Co based on his belief that expanding sales of the company's new 676 CMP product will boost gross margins.</p>
<p>-- In a written statement, Richard said he raised his estimate for fiscal 1997's second quarter, ending December 31, to a loss of $0.02 a share from a loss of $0.12 a share.</p>
<p>-- He boosted his estimate for fiscal year 1997, ending June, to a loss of $0.13 a share from a loss of $0.28 a share.</p>
</text>
